<title>JAPAN: BOXING-NICARAGUA'S ALVAREZ RETAINS WBA STRAWWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-NICARAGUA'S ALVAREZ RETAINS WBA STRAWWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rosendo Alvarez of Nicaragua knocked out Japanese challenger Takashi Shiohama in the eighth round of their scheduled 12-round bout to retain his World Boxing Association (WBA) strawweight title in Kitakyushu on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Alvarez, who won the title in December, 1995, extends his record to 22 wins.</p>
</text>
